From: metanoicarmor <72322348+MetanoicArmor@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Oct 2025 05:19:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add Apple Silicon support for macOS

- Add automatic architecture detection for macOS (Apple Silicon vs Intel)
- Use /opt/homebrew/opt/openssl@3 paths for Apple Silicon
- Maintain backward compatibility with Intel Mac paths
- Remove boost_system dependency (merged in newer Boost versions)
- Remove atomic library dependency (built into macOS standard library)
- Add patches for both main Makefile and i2pd submodule
- Include documentation and compatibility report

Fixes build issues on Apple Silicon Macs while maintaining
compatibility with all other platforms (Linux, FreeBSD, Windows).
