 Makefile                 | 16 +++++++----
 apple_silicon_main.patch | 48 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 i2pd_makefile_osx.patch  | 32 +++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 153 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
